1
00:00:08,196 --> 00:00:10,811
A body that shrinks to hair and nails.

2
00:00:10,891 --> 00:00:13,446
Rainbows over a small house in Tibet.

3
00:00:13,526 --> 00:00:16,422
It is a story that
catches the imagination.

4
00:00:16,502 --> 00:00:18,501
And that is exactly the danger.

5
00:00:18,581 --> 00:00:23,125
The rainbow body is easy to dismiss,
and just as easy to inflate.

6
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:25,461
This is After Anatta.

7
00:00:25,541 --> 00:00:29,945
In this short video I want to say why I
created these four videos in the first

8
00:00:30,025 --> 00:00:34,229
place, why they belong together, and
in what order I would watch them.

9
00:00:35,036 --> 00:00:37,012
First, why I made them.

10
00:00:37,092 --> 00:00:40,585
For many years the rainbow body
has been one of my interests.

11
00:00:40,665 --> 00:00:44,227
It is easy to dismiss, and
just as easy to inflate.

12
00:00:44,307 --> 00:00:47,719
To read it in a balanced way,
I looked into four things:

13
00:00:47,799 --> 00:00:51,699
the background of the five
elements, the practices of the body,

14
00:00:51,779 --> 00:00:54,879
the reports themselves,
and the body's own knowing.

15
00:00:54,959 --> 00:00:56,713
I made a video on each.

16
00:00:56,793 --> 00:00:59,000
No one of them is enough on its own.

17
00:00:59,808 --> 00:01:02,029
The first is about background.

18
00:01:02,109 --> 00:01:05,212
Five Elements: Chinese versus Tibet.

19
00:01:06,028 --> 00:01:10,042
When we hear the words five lights,
we bring our own world with us.

20
00:01:10,122 --> 00:01:13,153
Light, for us, is photons and waves.

21
00:01:13,233 --> 00:01:16,903
A body of light sounds like
physics, or like science fiction.

22
00:01:16,983 --> 00:01:20,993
But the five lights of the rainbow
body come from India and Tibet,

23
00:01:21,073 --> 00:01:23,249
and from a very different way of speaking.

24
00:01:23,329 --> 00:01:28,330
There, the five elements are not five
kinds of stuff. Earth is hardness.

25
00:01:28,410 --> 00:01:34,064
Water is cohesion. Fire is warmth.
Wind is motion. Space is room.

26
00:01:34,144 --> 00:01:36,242
They are qualities of what appears.

27
00:01:37,064 --> 00:01:40,426
And Tibet keeps two
different fives side by side.

28
00:01:40,506 --> 00:01:42,858
One came from India, with Buddhism.

29
00:01:42,938 --> 00:01:48,252
The other came from China, as divination
and the calendar. They meet in history.

30
00:01:48,332 --> 00:01:49,787
They never merge in view.

31
00:01:49,867 --> 00:01:54,176
Without this background, the five
lights are read through our own culture,

32
00:01:54,256 --> 00:01:56,205
and they go wrong from the start.

33
00:01:57,012 --> 00:02:00,374
The second video is about
the practices of the body.

34
00:02:00,454 --> 00:02:03,218
Inner Winds and Subtle Body Practices.

35
00:02:04,024 --> 00:02:06,380
Somatic practices are important.

36
00:02:06,460 --> 00:02:10,878
The habit of taking things as solid and
real on their own side does not live only

37
00:02:10,958 --> 00:02:15,620
in ideas. It lives in the muscles,
the diaphragm and the breath.

38
00:02:15,700 --> 00:02:18,812
You can feel it as a slight
tightening behind the eyes,

39
00:02:18,892 --> 00:02:23,201
a held, high chest, a guarded
belly, a leaning forward,

40
00:02:23,281 --> 00:02:25,524
as if you had to hold the world together.

41
00:02:25,604 --> 00:02:28,038
If emptiness stays a
deduction in the head,

42
00:02:28,118 --> 00:02:30,597
the body goes on bracing underneath.

43
00:02:31,412 --> 00:02:35,100
The street between insight
and the body runs both ways.

44
00:02:35,180 --> 00:02:37,097
Insight frees bound energy.

45
00:02:37,177 --> 00:02:41,812
In my own experience, as the logic took
apart what the mind was still leaning on,

46
00:02:41,892 --> 00:02:45,263
the mind and the body's
energy opened by themselves.

47
00:02:45,343 --> 00:02:49,543
And a balanced, supple body lets
the insight sink into the bones.

48
00:02:49,623 --> 00:02:51,948
When the breath is
settled low in the belly,

49
00:02:52,028 --> 00:02:55,888
and the body is not locked in
alarm or pulled up into the head,

50
00:02:55,968 --> 00:02:59,588
there is the quiet pliancy to
notice clinging as it forms.

51
00:03:00,384 --> 00:03:02,605
The traditions also agree on how.

52
00:03:02,685 --> 00:03:05,200
Balancing is settling, not forcing.

53
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:07,374
The breath sinks below the navel.

54
00:03:07,454 --> 00:03:09,955
The posture is upright but not stiff.

55
00:03:10,035 --> 00:03:13,637
Movement brings attention back
down into the hips and the feet.

56
00:03:13,717 --> 00:03:17,251
Forcing the breath, or pulling
everything up to the crown,

57
00:03:17,331 --> 00:03:19,969
has left many sleepless and unsettled.

58
00:03:20,049 --> 00:03:23,895
These practices are a re-balancing,
never an endurance test,

59
00:03:23,975 --> 00:03:27,595
and the forceful ones belong
only with a qualified teacher.

60
00:03:28,396 --> 00:03:31,731
The third video is the
traditions in their own words.

61
00:03:31,811 --> 00:03:36,110
Rainbow Body, According to Reports:
What the Traditions Report.

62
00:03:36,920 --> 00:03:41,586
Here I only report. Dzogchen,
with its two practices, trekchö,

63
00:03:41,666 --> 00:03:44,657
cutting through, and
thögal, direct crossing.

64
00:03:44,737 --> 00:03:48,434
The four visions, and the three
results the tradition names.

65
00:03:48,514 --> 00:03:52,551
Gelug, with its illusory body
made of wind, and tukdam.

66
00:03:52,631 --> 00:03:55,649
The Kālacakra's empty form. Bön.

67
00:03:55,729 --> 00:03:58,420
Other traditions that
tell of a body of light.

68
00:03:58,500 --> 00:04:01,260
And the reports themselves: what was seen,

69
00:04:01,340 --> 00:04:04,254
what was told, and what
has never been checked.

70
00:04:05,052 --> 00:04:08,047
The fourth video is about
another kind of knowing.

71
00:04:08,127 --> 00:04:12,861
The Body's Own Knowing: Felt Sense,
Inner Winds and the Rainbow Body.

72
00:04:13,672 --> 00:04:17,808
Knowing is not only analysis and
the taking apart of concepts.

73
00:04:17,888 --> 00:04:21,056
There is a more immediate
knowing, before words:

74
00:04:21,136 --> 00:04:23,447
the felt sense of presence in the body.

75
00:04:23,527 --> 00:04:28,297
A dog barks behind you, and your shoulders
have jumped before you know what it is.

76
00:04:28,377 --> 00:04:30,865
Fear and clinging are not only beliefs.

77
00:04:30,945 --> 00:04:34,126
They are bracing, held
breath and contraction,

78
00:04:34,206 --> 00:04:38,162
and they are often understood,
and loosened, more directly there.

79
00:04:38,242 --> 00:04:42,251
The inner-wind traditions are long
recognitions of this side of knowing,

80
00:04:42,331 --> 00:04:45,639
and modern research
supports it, within limits.

81
00:04:46,436 --> 00:04:49,961
The limits matter. Direct
is not the same as right.

82
00:04:50,041 --> 00:04:53,167
The body's knowing is
shaped by old expectations,

83
00:04:53,247 --> 00:04:55,763
and in anxiety it gives false alarms.

84
00:04:55,843 --> 00:04:58,453
It needs refining, as analysis does.

85
00:04:58,533 --> 00:05:01,659
And it is not a deeper
floor beneath experience.

86
00:05:01,739 --> 00:05:04,621
It is more immediate,
not more fundamental,

87
00:05:04,701 --> 00:05:06,528
and as empty as what it knows.

88
00:05:07,344 --> 00:05:09,986
For the rainbow body, this is the point.

89
00:05:10,066 --> 00:05:12,567
The body takes part in realization.

90
00:05:12,647 --> 00:05:16,440
That is why the traditions speak of
realization reaching all the way into the

91
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:21,756
body. That the body itself turns into
light remains reported, not shown.

92
00:05:22,564 --> 00:05:25,016
So this is the order
I would watch them in.

93
00:05:25,096 --> 00:05:29,160
First the background, so the words
are heard in their own culture.

94
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:31,198
Then the practices of the body.

95
00:05:31,278 --> 00:05:34,309
Then the reports, so we know
what the traditions hold,

96
00:05:34,389 --> 00:05:36,184
and how far the stories go.

97
00:05:36,264 --> 00:05:40,695
And then the body's own knowing, so the
body is understood as part of knowing,

98
00:05:40,775 --> 00:05:42,765
not only something to be trained.

99
00:05:43,568 --> 00:05:46,101
Each one guards against
a different mistake.

100
00:05:46,181 --> 00:05:49,457
Without the background, the
lights become modern light.

101
00:05:49,537 --> 00:05:53,234
Without the practices, the
view stays an idea in the head.

102
00:05:53,314 --> 00:05:56,699
Without the reports, the
stories are taken for facts,

103
00:05:56,779 --> 00:05:58,520
or dismissed out of hand.

104
00:05:58,600 --> 00:06:03,470
Without the body's own knowing, the body
is left out of realization altogether.

105
00:06:04,284 --> 00:06:06,437
Together they give a balanced reading.

106
00:06:06,517 --> 00:06:10,123
Neither dismissing the rainbow
body, nor inflating it.

